1. **Import Module:**
```javascript
const { Document } = require('/document.js');
const doc = Document.current;
```
2. **Defensive Guard:**
```javascript
if (!doc) {
  console.log('No active document found.');
  return;
}
```
3. **Log Core Telemetry:**
```javascript
console.log('Title :', doc.title);
console.log('UUID  :', doc.sessionUuid);
console.log('Canvas:', doc.widthPixels + 'x' + doc.heightPixels + ' px');
console.log('DPI   :', doc.dpi);
```
4. **Call MCP Render Tool:** Pass `doc.sessionUuid` to `render_spread` to generate a live preview image in 180ms!
